---

<section class="cta">
  <div class="cta-inner">
    <h2>Ready to reclaim<br>your digital sovereignty?</h2>
    <p>
      Sovereign Agents extend your capabilities while preserving your agency —
      protected by silicon, not terms of service.
    </p>
    <div class="cta-actions">
      <a href="https://github.com/sovereign-agents" target="_blank" class="btn-primary">Get started</a>
      <a href="#architecture" class="btn-ghost">View architecture</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .cta {
    padding: 8rem 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid #1A1A1D;
  }

  .cta-inner {
    max-width: 36rem;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #F5F5F5;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .cta p {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #8A8A8E;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
    background: #F5F5F5;
    color: #09090B;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { opacity: 0.88; }

  .btn-ghost {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.75rem;
    background: transparent;
    color: #8A8A8E;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    border: 1px solid #222225;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover { color: #F5F5F5; border-color: #444; }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .cta { padding: 5rem 1.25rem; }
  }
</style>
